      "title": "The gunzels’ grand final: Melbourne Tramaroos’ campaign derails at European TramDriver Championship",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/sep/20/the-gunzels-grand-final-melbourne-tramaroos-campaign-derails-at-european-tramdriver-championship",
      "description": "<p>The Warsaw event saw 26 teams compete across a series of demanding tasks, inspired - to varying degrees - by tram drivers’ day-to-day tasks</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>It’s the grand final for gunzels. But despite having one of the largest tram networks in the world, Melbourne’s Tramaroos finished second last at this year’s European TramDriver Championship, just ahead of London.</p><p>The event, held in Warsaw on Saturday, saw 26 teams compete across a series of demanding tasks, inspired – to varying degrees – by tram drivers’ day-to-day work.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/sep/20/the-gunzels-grand-final-melbourne-tramaroos-campaign-derails-at-european-tramdriver-championship\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-09-20T08:16:39"
    },
    {
      "title": "One child dead and two children in critical condition after Blue Mountains stabbing",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/sep/20/blue-mountains-stabbing-nsw-police-one-child-dead-and-two-children-and-woman-in-critical-condition-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Crime scene established at Waratah Road, Valley Heights as NSW police say they ‘are not looking for any other people at this time’</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>A child has died in a stabbing attack in the Blue Mountains, with two other children and a woman in hospital in critical condition, New South Wales police say.</p><p>In a statement on Sunday afternoon, police said emergency services responded to reports of three children and a woman with stab wounds in a vehicle on Waratah Road, Valley Heights.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/sep/20/blue-mountains-stabbing-nsw-police-one-child-dead-and-two-children-and-woman-in-critical-condition-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-09-20T07:30:42"
    }
